  value_nonneg : ∀ rank, 0 ≤ value rank
  value_mono : ∀ rank, value (rank + 1) ≤ value rank

/--
The standard ordered-rank assumptions imply the exact finite `B*`
local-optimality certificate. The only nontrivial field is the continuation
`B*` value bound, which follows from the Theorem 7 VCG-tail upper bound.
