strategy is a PBE iff it is the named finite `B*` ranked-threshold strategy.
-/
theorem paper_theorem8_bstar_ranked_threshold_dynamic_game_pbe_iff_strategy_eq_of_local_optimality_extensional_outcome_certificate
    {Belief : Type*}
